@startuml
title SD-B33a Hapus Foto Galeri Cabang (Per-Item)

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam BoxPadding 4
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #999999
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #999999
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECEEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #111111
    ActorBorderColor #999999
    ActorFontColor #111111
    GroupBorderColor #111111
    GroupBackgroundColor transparent
}

actor "Owner" as Owner
boundary "Detail Cabang / Halaman Edit Cabang" as HalamanCabang
boundary "Tombol Hapus Foto" as TombolHapus
control "StudioLocationController" as StudioLocationController
control "StorageService" as StorageService
entity "StudioLocations Model" as StudioLocation

Owner -> HalamanCabang : Membuka detail atau form edit cabang
HalamanCabang --> Owner : daftar foto galeri tampil\n(setiap foto punya tombol hapus sendiri)

Owner -> TombolHapus : Klik hapus pada salah satu foto
TombolHapus -> StudioLocationController : destroyPhoto(location_code, photo_index)

note right of StudioLocationController
  photo_index adalah posisi foto
  di dalam array JSON photo_gallery.
  Bukan ID database.
end note

StudioLocationController -> StudioLocation : ambil data cabang\nbeserta photo_gallery saat ini
StudioLocation --> StudioLocationController : data cabang dan array galeri

StudioLocationController -> StudioLocationController : validasi photo_index\nada di dalam array galeri

alt photo_index valid
    StudioLocationController -> StorageService : hapus file fisik foto\ndari storage/public berdasarkan path
    StorageService --> StudioLocationController : file terhapus
    StudioLocationController -> StudioLocationController : forget(index) dari array\nvalues() untuk reindex dari 0\nsyncPhotos() simpan ulang galeri
    StudioLocationController -> StudioLocation : UPDATE photo_gallery\n(array tanpa foto yang dihapus)
    StudioLocation --> StudioLocationController : galeri diperbarui
    StudioLocationController -> StudioLocationController : Cache::forget\n('landing.page.data.v2')
    StudioLocationController --> HalamanCabang : redirect dengan pesan berhasil
    HalamanCabang --> Owner : foto terhapus,\nsisa foto galeri masih ada
else photo_index tidak valid / tidak ditemukan
    StudioLocationController --> HalamanCabang : redirect dengan pesan error
    HalamanCabang --> Owner : foto tidak ditemukan
end

@enduml
